# Python leftovers from the pre-Batch-1 stack (ROADMAP 11.17). Deliberately narrow: the old
# generic Python template ignored lib/ and then had to re-include it, because our shared
# TypeScript game logic lives there, so any new lib-like folder could vanish silently.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
dist/

